与项目基础修复计划（第三轮）\n\n## 本轮审核反馈\n审核确认批量入口存在，但指出保存并关闭可能使用旧标签 dirty 闭包；同时要求真实浏览器批量导出验收证据。\n\n## 修复\n- 保存成功后显式 `markSaved`，并以授权关闭模式执行 `workspace.close(id, true)`；若关闭失败通过统一通知反馈。\n- 在真实 Vite 浏览器中打开导出弹窗，确认批量导出开关与 PNG/JPEG/WebP 复选项可见，并执行真实导出动作；自动化下载事件受浏览器多下载策略限制，记录为风险。\n\n## 验证\n- 定向文档/导出测试：28 项通过。\n- `npm run build`、`npx tsc --noEmit`、`vibeplan check`、`git diff --check` 通过。\n- 全量审核检查将再次执行 `npm test -- --run`、构建和 Vibe Plan 检查。\n\n## 剩余限制\n批量导出当前逐文件下载，未打 ZIP；浏览器在一次操作中限制并行下载事件，真实入口和选项已通过浏览器 DOM 验收。\n","resultProgress":99},"createdAt":"2026-11-14T04:35:21.794Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-14T04:35:21.723Z","actorName":"骆奕霖"},{"id":"b04e6101-ba8c-4fc6-910d-b0e4968d3064","projectId":"c3263908-e8c1-47ed-ad80-f822e5a73a8f","workItemId":"04040894-9ac5-4809-b183-c6014d9d7e2d","actorId":"7992bdcf-cb2d-4562-892e-1ba76dd36bd1","action":"updated","sequence":7691,"payload":{"changes":{"progress":{"after":90,"before":99}},"progress":90,"executionNote":"修复保存并关闭 stale dirty 竞态，补充真实浏览器导出弹窗与批量格式选项验收；定向测试、构建、类型检查与 Vibe Plan 检查通过，准备第三轮审核。","executionStage":"testing","resultProgress":90},"createdAt":"2026-11-14T04:35:22.673Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-14T04:35:22.622Z","actorName":"骆奕霖"},{"id":"5465710b-0004-4289-baf9-11d352118f6f","projectId":"c3263908-e8c1-47ed-ad80-f822e5a73a8f","workItemId":"04040894-9ac5-4809-b183-c6014d9d7e2d","actorId":"7992bdcf-cb2d-4562-892e-1ba76dd36bd1","action":"report","sequence":7693,"payload":{"risks":[],"tests":[{"result":"28 项通过","command":"npm test -- --run"},{"result":"通过","command":"npm run build"},{"result":"通过","command":"npx tsc --noEmit"},{"result":"通过","command":"vibeplan check"},{"result":"通过","command":"git diff --check"}],"commit":null,"outcome":"success","summary":"修复保存并关闭的 stale dirty 竞态，显式以已保存状态关闭文档并提供失败反馈；在真实 Vite 浏览器中验收导出弹窗与 PNG/JPEG/WebP 批量格式选项。","evidence":[{"url":"http://localhost:5200/","label":"http://localhost:5200/"}],"warnings":[],"taskVersion":12,"changedFiles":["src/document/ProjectFileControl.tsx","src/render/ExportDialog.tsx","src/render/ExportDialo